# Expectations written in the comments of X8Stest.elan (Mathematisch Centrum,
# 1971-72), one line per test number as counted by pustat.py. Registers in
# octal; C L O P N are the one-bit registers C, LT, OF, the parity bit and NINT
# read from T. Two comments disagree with the code of X8S itself; we follow
# X8S and say so: test 42 ("a = s = -0": X8S gives A the sign of the old A,
# +0) and test 71 ("of = 0": the same operands set OF in test 68, and X8S sets
# it here too).
